CORE broken-smt-backend
event2.sv
--random-trace --trace-steps 1
^  main\.e = (null|32'h[0-9A-F]+) \([01]+\)$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Random traces need random values of the lowered type of event.
The SMT2 back-end does not return the values of bv-typed variables,
which are shown as ?.
